  message: "Fixed in PR #2276 (7b1a61e2e): cfg._process_body records a child_count==0 body as one statement, and python.yaml moves lambda to nested_function, so late_capture_edges sees the read. Live re-run on dev 3c109b3aa with claims_fs.yaml (fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr2/pubat_sweep.txt): filed repro js_arrow -> violated, rc 1 (was confirmed 0 at 10.0.0, inconclusive 4 after WI-buzup). Sweep, each with its control: py_lambda violated 1 (ctl violated 1); java_lambda and java_lambda_nouse violated 1 (ctls violated 1); rs_closure and rs_closure_nouse violated 1 (ctls violated 1); ts_arrow violated 1 (ctl violated 1); js_block violated 1; precision control ts_noread (closure reads no captured name) confirmed_with_caveats 3. C# is not mapped. Tests test_ddg_late_capture.py; 4/4 mutations red."  # 995e
